					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p><strong>SPC-993:</strong> &quot;Bobble the Clown Shark&quot;<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600579166" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;">▷ <strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/crispy-sex-pirates" target="_blank">Entry for DAY ONE</a></strong> ◁</p> <p style="text-align: center;">▷ <strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4190" target="_blank">Entry for DAY THREE</a></strong> ◁</p> <hr /> <p>This is a tale for <strong>Day 2</strong> of the <strong><a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/144-hour-jam-contest">144-Hour Jam Contest</a></strong>. The theme was &quot;Pulp Fiction&quot;.</p> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷&nbsp;Special&nbsp;Thanks&nbsp;and&nbsp;Image&nbsp;Attribution</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:110%;"><strong>Special Thanks &#8212; Critters &amp; Beta Readers</strong></span></p> <p>▷ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600579166" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span><br /> ▷ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cryonicautumn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4899605&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600579166" alt="CryonicAutumn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4899605)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cryonicautumn" >CryonicAutumn</a></span><br /> ▷ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=414239&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600579166" alt="Gabriel Jade" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=414239)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" >Gabriel Jade</a></span></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:110%;"><strong>Image Attribution</strong></span></p> <p>▷ <strong><a href="https://pixabay.com/illustrations/shark-graphic-predator-2278001/" target="_blank">Shark Silhouette</a> – CC0 (Edited)</strong><br /> ▷ <strong><a href="https://pixabay.com/illustrations/shark-animal-character-cute-ocean-1454245/" target="_blank">Cartoon Shark</a> – CC0 (Edited)</strong><br /> ▷ <strong><a href="https://www.publicdomainpictures.net/en/view-image.php?image=232547&amp;picture=red-nose" target="_blank">Red Nose</a> – CC0 (Edited)</strong></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:110%;"><strong>Inspiration</strong></span></p> <p>▷ <strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-993">SCP-993</a> - Bobble the Clown</strong> by <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=776854&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600579166" alt="Tanhony" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=776854)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" >Tanhony</a></span></strong><br /> ▷ VoiceoverPete's &quot;<strong><a target="_blank" href="https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/people/voiceoverpete">Attention Fortnite Gamers</a></strong>&quot; meme<br /> ▷ Pulp magazine hero <strong><a target="_blank" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doc_Savage">Clark Savage, Jr. AKA Doc Savage</a></strong></p> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">△&nbsp;Close</a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷&nbsp;Fan&nbsp;Art!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:110%;"><strong>Fan Art!</strong></span></p> <p>▷ <strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/caimanchameleon/SPC-993" target="_blank">Low-Poly Bobble the Clown Shark</a></strong> by <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/caimanchameleon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3151572&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600579166" alt="CaimanChameleon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3151572)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/caimanchameleon" >CaimanChameleon</a></span> (</strong><a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/caimanchameleon">Art Page</a><strong>)</strong></p> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">△&nbsp;Close</a></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:130%;"><strong><a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/floppyphoenix">If you liked this, check out my Author Page!</a></strong></span></p> 
